  m_text: <b>Himadri  </b>has an average height of approximately 6000 m, a granite
    core, with glaciers  such as Gangotri, Siachen. The peaks in this division are
    Everest, Kanchenjunga, Nanda Devi. Himadri is also known as Greater Himalaya.
